Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gelies cerca
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who are facing the direction of the sea of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sea of the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a ringer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a ringer, a ringer
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.77,0:01:35.61,Title 3,ep,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,930)\pos(192,815)\fscx86}Episode 20: Death 13, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.32,0:01:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is Saudi Arabia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About 8,800 kilometers from Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.96,0:01:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's been around four weeks\Nsince we began our journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.92,0:02:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry, we'll\Nbe in serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.60,0:02:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.86,0:02:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think is up with Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First he nearly kills us in his sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.70,0:02:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he looks like he's\Ncoming apart at the seams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even went after the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's just not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, he's at his wit's end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.86,0:02:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we may have to send him packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a second there I thought\Nhe'd actually figured me out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now the poor louse is half\Ndoubting himself to top things
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off we're in the middle of\Nthe desert all I have to do is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:03:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait until they fall asleep if\Nthere's no one to wake them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.34,0:03:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of food is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is baby food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a delicious concoction of milk,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,egg yolks, bananas and\Nbread, all stewed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want to taste it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.00,0:03:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate there won't\Nbe any left for the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You incompetent bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you eat my food?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wasting away over here, so\Nhurry up and feed me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a scorpion!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap baskets!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin was watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed the scorpion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That baby really is a... Shit! What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar. Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That baby's not normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just killed a scorpion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stabbed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boy skewered it\Nwith his own safety pin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A baby, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid is a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even a year old yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he knew what a scorpion was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he killed it with\Nthose tiny hands of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A scorpion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is it? It's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:05:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There should be an impaled scorpion here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have hidden it somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check his clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We get the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said before, you're\Nclearly exhausted. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's table this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll talk after you've calmed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, here's the Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were hungry a minute ago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you lose that big appetite?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:06:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop shoving\Nthat spoon in my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't eat right now, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.60,0:06:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, listen, I'm not imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know where he could have\Nhidden the blasted scorpion,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure that he's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have just the thing to prove to you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I'm telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see these cuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Read what the letters spell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that it's a warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have happened to me\Nwhen I was sleeping earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, you didn't do that to\Nyourself, did you? Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.92,0:06:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally happened. Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You colossal buffoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How stupid can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.98,0:06:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you realize if you showed\Nthem the cuts on your arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'd think you were crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I make things even worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it looks like I have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for a little force!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I revenge Green!
