Dialogue: 3,0:07:05.57,0:07:05.61,SFX4,1,0,0,0,,{=34}{\blur1\bord0\fscx135.42\fscy104.17\pos(1614.03,634.35)\frz357.5\4a&HFF&}Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy's completely lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.42,0:07:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Jotaro, his stand was the one\Nwe fought in our dreams, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't fall asleep, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we fall asleep, we'll all be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, my secret is still safe,\Nwhich means the end is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your petty mistrust just\Ncost you your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory is mine, fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:08:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's like this, does that mean Kakyoin\Ncan't fight or travel with us anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll discuss it in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, give me a hand\Nmoving Kakyoin. Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you bring the\Nsleeping bags. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's just really heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.34,0:08:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got you right where I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna slice you up and scatter\Nyour remains all over the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.66,0:08:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world why\Nare we in the middle of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:08:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an amusement park we were\Njust out in the desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. I know this\Nplace, Dotero, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.76,0:09:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be on your guard my memory\Nis coming back we've
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been transported to a\Ndream world a horrible one
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is bad we've entered\Na world of nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so it's a dream, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had me a little\Nworried for a minute there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make the same mistake that I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, everything Kakyoin\Nsaid to us earlier is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby, stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.14,0:09:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are in enemy territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know none of this makes any kind of\Nsense, but the stand user is that baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one left to wake\Nyou from your slumber now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that means there's absolutely no\Nway for you to escape Death 13's world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll finally finish you\Noff once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I have to hit\NKakyoin and knock him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since I did that, he\Nshould already be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in the world are you, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way\Nto make this up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polareff, good lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on with your hair?
