Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, Bricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to fight this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's maddening!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, anything can happen in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no rules here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:10:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we're in this place,\Nwe're completely at his mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I remember there being one rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His murder weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, if he wants to slice us to pieces,\Nthen he'll have to use his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And nothing but his stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lali-hoo!
