Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand is a manifestation of the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what are dreams if\Nnot the mind laid bare?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Death 13 has trapped you\Nwithin your subconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is why you can't\Nsummon your precious stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although,
