Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.41,0:12:44.45,SFXBlue,7,0,0,0,,{=16}{\blur0.9\fade(255,0,255,-800,-800,-410,40)\frz354.2\pos(383.52,562.49)\c&H261815&}Slice!!
