Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they would have appeared here with\Nyou, just like your clothes, sleeping bags,?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and your prosthetic hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:13:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death 13 will never be forced\Nto face another stand in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as you know, the only thing that\Ncan defeat a stand is another stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'll always come out on top!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I have all of you in my\Ncrosshairs, how about you give me a scream?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that captures the joy and elation\NI'm about to feel in my easy victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loli! Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loli-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just one of the fakes I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This went to Hyra-Fans!
