Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for your punishment, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.29,0:14:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up, Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had Hierophant place\Nhimself in your blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep up this futile struggling...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't care that\Nyou're a baby. I'll snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karkuin, the three of us\Nowe you an enormous apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought after the hell you'd\Nbeen through on this trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.82,0:14:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suddenly lost your sanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, a baby stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were fighting this battle\Nalone, and for that, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't have been helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were the reason I found a way to\Nbring my stand to the dream world with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't hit me, we'd be stuck\Nhere without a way to defend ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:15:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, in a way, this is\Nall thanks to you. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.68,0:15:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, now I feel conflicted\Nabout the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin hasn't killed me\Nyet because I'm a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, that compassion\Nof yours is a fatal flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you've forgotten, you're all\Nstill trapped inside my nightmare world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.10,0:15:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Closing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you now, don't\Ntry anything! Death 13!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, you have to get Hierophant\Naway from his back before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll chop you in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.24,0:15:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.60,0:15:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He chopped himself in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lally-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you figured it out yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death 13's body is as hollow\Nas the space between your ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.46,0:16:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand is only comprised of the head,\Narms, and the giant siphon wheels!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gigantic ignoramuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.28,0:16:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,given the way the stands work,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.28,0:16:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin's body should also be split\Nin two inside the sleeping bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.27,0:16:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you sure you're all right? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.50,0:16:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you know Hierophant\Nisn't that careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't just stay on the enemy's\Nback without a plan in the wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not chopped in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's turned into a snake-like thing,\Nand he's slithering into my ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my arm is moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you before, my stand was in your\Nblind spot, and your scythe couldn't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, unless you'd like to\Nbe destroyed from the inside out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.06,0:17:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how about you do me a favor\Nand heal the cuts on my arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.18,0:17:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything is possible in a dream, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.03,0:17:31.07,SFXGreen3,11,0,0,0,,{=32}{\blur0.8\bord2.91\fscx47.33\fscy36.41\frz7.283\pos(931,479.56)\c&H1A1D1B&}Doom
