Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So healing a cut should be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.12,0:17:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Polnareff. Up and at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a nice breakfast waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I had a\Nterrible dream last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.28,0:18:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and me both.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember it, but I have the\Nsneaking suspicion that it was terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakuine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.23,0:18:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you like a deranged\Nlunatic last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You even carved letters in your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did the wound go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I think I'll change\Nthe baby's diaper now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's morning, Sleepyhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems to be getting along\Nfamously with the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I just dreamed the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, did you have a good rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand whose very existence\Nis completely forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.06,0:19:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a strange creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I haven't forgotten anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.36,0:19:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I brought my stand into the\Ndream with me, my memories are intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Injury you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.14,0:19:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take you to a nearby town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to be returned to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, don't come\Nanywhere near us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do, you'll have to be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a manner such as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.26,0:19:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that my poop?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Akemi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you've made some baby\Nfood for the little lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he must be starving by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, no, you wouldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.74,0:19:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These yum-yums are delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.12,0:19:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.64,0:20:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.84,0:20:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.10,0:20:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if he doesn't like this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'll have to force-feed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't force it, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do, he'll just end\Nup hating it even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In special cases like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goji-goo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goji-goo-ji-goo-ji-goo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.54,0:20:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goji-goo-ji-goo-ji-goo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you it was\Ndelicious, but I'm bummed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and the others have now\Ncrossed the Arabian Peninsula
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and are currently making\Ntheir way across the Red Sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.36,0:20:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as they prepare to enter Egypt, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.14,0:20:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man. Something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.02,0:21:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going the wrong direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're headed to Egypt, shouldn't\Nyou be traveling directly west? Hmm?
