Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.67,0:21:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a man who is extremely\Nimportant to our journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you move too quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.18,0:22:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the birds are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.84,0:22:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the money on\Na bed Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.46,0:22:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with a hookah. I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.76,0:22:15.18,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.18,0:22:17.44,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.44,0:22:18.90,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.84,0:22:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.69,0:22:22.15,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.15,0:22:24.48,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.48,0:22:26.82,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.82,0:22:28.32,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.99,0:22:31.45,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.45,0:22:33.66,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.74,0:22:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink, tick off books.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.72,0:22:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.67,0:22:43.21,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.78,0:22:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.96,0:22:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.02,0:22:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.60,0:22:57.06,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.06,0:22:59.44,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.44,0:23:00.69,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.98,0:23:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ended up killing my friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.73,0:23:04.07,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I could possibly do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.64,0:23:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to thank you for\Nfreeing me from the lab.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.40,0:23:08.74,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't believe it\Nif it wasn't right here.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.74,0:23:10.20,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.90,0:23:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me your three wishes.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.03,0:23:13.37,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.54,0:23:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have the ability to revive someone?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.37,0:23:15.58,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.71,0:23:25.80,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
